WEBVTT

00:01:58.356 --> 00:02:00.996
We need five times that,

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:02.196
all of it clean,

00:02:02.196 --> 00:02:05.956
or 12 times today's clean
electricity production,

00:02:05.956 --> 00:02:08.836
to actually avoid the worst
impacts of climate change.

00:02:10.116 --> 00:02:11.316
Can I repeat that?

00:02:11.356 --> 00:02:13.476
To avoid the worst
impacts of climate change,

00:02:13.516 --> 00:02:18.396
we have to multiply today's clean
electricity production by 12 times.

00:02:19.636 --> 00:02:22.356
There are four main reasons
we need that much.

00:02:22.796 --> 00:02:27.276
First, let’s keep in mind scientists’
goalpost for addressing climate change:

00:02:27.276 --> 00:02:31.276
achieving net-negative emissions
globally by around 2050.